Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:14.18,Logo,,0,0,0,,переведено и озвучено студией "два дебила" в 2026 году.\Nприятного просмотра!            
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.89,0:00:20.10,пупа,,0,0,0,,Меня зовут сержант пупа.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:23.06,пупа,,0,0,0,,Я работаю день и ночь над расследованиями по убийствам. 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.06,0:00:24.60,пупа,,0,0,0,,И это - место перступления.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:27.77,пупа,,0,0,0,,Часть города, о которой знают все, но никто не хочет и слышать.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.77,0:00:33.19,пупа,,0,0,0,,Здесь воруют, торгуют наркотой, а шанс преступлений выше, чем где-либо ещё.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.82,пупа,,0,0,0,,Бомжатник.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:44.87,Comment,,0,0,0,,Плотоядное растение в бомжатнике
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.27,0:01:55.15,пупа,,0,0,0,,Самый ужасный этап моей карьеры начался в лавке "свежие бутоны мясника"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.82,0:02:02.49,мясник,,0,0,0,,О, доброе утро вшивая, как у вас дела сегодня?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.49,0:02:09.33,вшивая,,0,0,0,,Ой, да как обычно... племянник моей сестры, Саня, сегодня издох в арканзасе...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.33,0:02:10.58,мясник,,0,0,0,,А что случилось?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.59,вшивая,,0,0,0,,Да он как-то умудрился взорваться
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:16.84,мясник,,0,0,0,,Как мило. Вам как обычно, цветов на похороны?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.84,0:02:43.66,Comment,,0,0,0,,(Сёма что-то поёт на заднем плане)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:30.19,вшивая,,0,0,0,,Ну, наверное да, вы же всегда меня с цветами выручали... Может я потом наследство на вас перепишу, если скидку сделаете...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:35.27,мясник,,0,0,0,,Я что по вашему, флорист? я просто торгую на этой свалке...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.27,0:02:39.11,мясник,,0,0,0,,...каким-то завядшим говном и я только рад срезать вам цену,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.11,0:02:43.66,мясник,,0,0,0,,Но даже не могу позволить себе воду для цветов. Тут только глотку себе резать, а не цены.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:49.37,Comment,,0,0,0,,(Сёма что-то {\b1}ГРОМКО{\b0} поёт на заднем плане)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:50.75,мясник,,0,0,0,,ЗАТКНИСЬ УЖЕ ТАМ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:56.05,мясник,,0,0,0,,Простите, миссис вшивая, этот семен...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.05,0:02:57.46,вшивая,,0,0,0,,Ой, да ладно вам...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:58.46,надя,,0,0,0,,Ну за что ты так с ним?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:07.18,мясник,,0,0,0,,За что? У нас тут новый желтопузый посетитель, и мне надо бы поручить это ЕМУ, но у меня даже нет сейчас времени за ним бегать!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:17.07,мясник,,0,0,0,,Свежие бутоны мясника, здравствуйте. О, здоров, Зубной Федя. Чем могу помочь?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.07,0:03:22.07,федя,,0,0,0,,Слушай сюда, мясник. Мне нужно два гладиолуса и папоротник. С доставкой.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:24.91,мясник,,0,0,0,,Отлично! Две дюжины гладиолусов и папоротник в горшке
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:28.87,федя,,0,0,0,,Мясник, ты глухой? Два гладиолуса и папоротник.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:32.37,Comment,,0,0,0,,(пациент орёт)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:34.21,мясник,,0,0,0,,Хочешь чтобы я положил два гладиолуса в один горшок с папаротником?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.21,0:03:39.63,федя,,0,0,0,,Ну реально глухой... Нет. Всё по отдельности. Мне это нужно для приёмной.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:41.72,Comment,,0,0,0,,пвомва вывава
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:42.17,федя,,0,0,0,,Ась?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:43.30,Comment,,0,0,0,,пвомба выпала
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:45.30,федя,,0,0,0,,Ладно, щас рассверлим побольше...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:49.89,мясник,,0,0,0,,Значит ты хочешь два гладиолуса со скидкой за состояние и такой же папоротник? Это что за украшение такое?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:55.94,федя,,0,0,0,,Это называется "мой бюджет на неделю", мясник. Не буду же я задирать цены ради цветов?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:04:00.28,мясник,,0,0,0,,Прекрасно, отлично, семён уже в пути. Не буду же я спорить с учёным...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.28,0:04:02.61,федя,,0,0,0,,Мгм. Давай, поторопи его.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:09.16,федя,,0,0,0,,Так, а теперь твоя очередь. Ну ты сейчас у меня получишь, ой получишь!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:14.16,мясник,,0,0,0,,СЕМЁНИЩЕ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:18.38,мясник,,0,0,0,,Итак, миссис вшивая, продолжая разговор о цветах для похорон, я немного...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:23.51,сёма,,0,0,0,,Вы меня звали, мистер Мясник?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.51,0:04:28.72,мясник,,0,0,0,,Нет, я звал главу центробанка чтобы одолжить денег на Аурус.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:30.06,сёма,,0,0,0,,Простите...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.06,0:04:33.02,мясник,,0,0,0,,А теперь слушай внимательно.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:36.23,мясник,,0,0,0,,Берешь два гладиолуса, красиво их обрезаешь...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.23,0:04:42.82,мясник,,0,0,0,,...пакуешь все это в кулек вместе с папоротником и относишь Зубному Феде. Понял?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.82,0:04:43.78,мясник,,0,0,0,,ИДИ УЖЕ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:46.57,мясник,,0,0,0,,Что я могу для вас сделать, сэр?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.57,0:04:47.95,борщев,,0,0,0,,Здрасьте, меня зовут борис борщев.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:49.87,мясник,,0,0,0,,Отлично! Я - Гравий Мясник.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.87,0:04:50.70,борщев,,0,0,0,,Прекрасное имя!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:52.45,вшивая,,0,0,0,,А как же мои розы?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:55.33,надя,,0,0,0,,Сейчас помогу вам, миссис Вшивая. Идёмте сюда.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:59.25,мясник,,0,0,0,,Может, хотите немного орхидей для вашей девушки?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:01.38,борщев,,0,0,0,,Нет, я, пожалуй возьму пару дюжин гвоздик.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.38,0:05:02.59,мясник,,0,0,0,,Гвоздик. Отлично.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.26,0:05:06.88,вшивая,,0,0,0,,(неразборчивое старушеское причитание)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:09.64,надя,,0,0,0,,Вам и так уже досталось, миссис вшивая
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.64,0:05:15.02,вшивая,,0,0,0,,досталось мне, ага...  (что-то на бабкинском)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.02,0:05:16.48,мясник,,0,0,0,,Гвоздики, гвоздики...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.48,0:05:18.77,надя,,0,0,0,,Вы сказали что хотите роз...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:22.86,вшивая,,0,0,0,,Да, да, для Стенли...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:25.36,борщев,,0,0,0,,Так что там с гвоздиками..?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:33.12,мясник,,0,0,0,,Нет, ну вы видели что... Видели, Борян? А, вот ваши гвоздики. Погодите, сейчас вам их заверну...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:35.08,борщев,,0,0,0,,Не стоит, я их и так съем.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:41.21,мясник,,0,0,0,,А почему нет?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:44.67,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ладно, что-то ещё?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:47.13,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ну, вкусно?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.13,0:05:48.22,борщев,,0,0,0,,Бывало и получше.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:50.14,надя,,0,0,0,,Ну, это небольшой магазин.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:51.35,борщев,,0,0,0,,А, ничё страшного.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:52.51,борщев,,0,0,0,,Знаете, в больших магазинах...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.51,0:05:54.64,борщев,,0,0,0,,Там куча дорогих, красивых цветов...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:57.68,борщев,,0,0,0,,Когда их растят ради красоты, они сильно теряют во вкусе. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.68,0:05:59.69,борщев,,0,0,0,,Мне нравятся такие вот... бомжатнички.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:02.98,вшивая,,0,0,0,,Ах! Ну и диво... Цветы ест!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:06.19,борщев,,0,0,0,,Ой, не пробовала - не критикуй.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.28,0:06:08.86,сёма,,0,0,0,,Посмотрите, что я наделал...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.41,0:06:14.49,мясник,,0,0,0,,Вот, о чем я и говорил. Посмотрите на него!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:16.66,мясник,,0,0,0,,Посмотрите на {\i1\b1}качество{\i0\b0} его работы!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:21.33,мясник,,0,0,0,,Скажите, если я его уволю, сможет ли он найти такую же хорошую работу?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:22.33,сёма,,0,0,0,,Я что, уволен..?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:27.33,мясник,,0,0,0,,Нет, я провозглашаю тебя президентом россии. ДА, ТЫ УВОЛЕН!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:28.72,надя,,0,0,0,,Гравий, ты не можешь так поступить!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:29.76,мясник,,0,0,0,,кто не может? я не могу?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.14,0:06:31.89,сёма,,0,0,0,,Я не хотел...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:34.18,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ты не хотел. Ты никогда не хотел!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:38.10,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ты не хотел, когда принёс букет с открыткой "выздоравливай" ...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.10,0:06:39.81,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ты не хотел, когда принёс букет с открыткой "выздоравливай" ДЛЯ ПОКОЙНИКА!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:43.77,мясник,,0,0,0,,И отправил черные лилии бабуле в больнице, "ты не хотел"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:48.19,мясник,,0,0,0,,Но сейчас, я, Гравий Мясник, хочу!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.19,0:06:50.45,борщев,,0,0,0,,Он походу тебя уволить хочет.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.45,0:06:57.79,сёма,,0,0,0,,Ну мистер мясник, разве я не пытаюсь всегда всё делать правильно? Я люблю цветы! Почти так же сильно, как Надя!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:06:59.54,мясник,,0,0,0,,Отлично, ты уволен.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.79,надя,,0,0,0,,Почему бы не дать ему шанс исправиться?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:03.08,мясник,,0,0,0,,Я даю ему шанс уволиться.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:04.25,сёма,,0,0,0,,Я не хочу увольняться...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.25,0:07:06.46,сёма,,0,0,0,,Ты - смелый малый, но ты уволен.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:15.05,сёма,,0,0,0,,Но это не честно, мистер мясник... Я для вас даже специально растение растил, чтобы подарить... Вы такого ни разу в жизни не видели!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:17.76,мясник,,0,0,0,,Отлично! я даже не могу продать цветы, что у меня в магазине
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:18.64,мясник,,0,0,0,,На выход!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:21.73,борщев,,0,0,0,,Подождите. Если у него и вправду есть что-то этакое - почему бы вам не...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:24.15,мясник,,0,0,0,,Мне даже не интересны цветы, мистер желтопуз
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:27.07,мясник,,0,0,0,,Моя семья занимается цветочным бизнесом уже две сотни лет,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:30.07,мясник,,0,0,0,,Но у меня один единственный магазин на ленинской, вот этот задрипанный бомжатник.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:31.40,мясник,,0,0,0,,Я даже никода не любил цветы!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:36.03,борщев,,0,0,0,,Вы не понимаете, что я имел в виду. Я обедал в цветочных магазинах по всему миру...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:39.37,борщев,,0,0,0,,И заметил, что магазинчики с самыми странными и необычными цветами имели больше всего покупателей.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:41.46,надя,,0,0,0,,Вот, видите?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.46,сёма,,0,0,0,,Видите?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:41.46,вшивая,,0,0,0,,Видите?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.87,мясник,,0,0,0,,Вы чего все накинулись?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.87,0:07:47.21,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ладно, давай дальше.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.21,0:07:51.01,борщев,,0,0,0,,Что же. я помню одно местечко, в котором была стена, покрытая ядовитым плющём.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.01,0:07:53.93,борщев,,0,0,0,,Народ приезжал за три-девять земель, чтобы поглядеть и оставался, чтобы что-то купить.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.93,0:07:55.22,мясник,,0,0,0,,И владелец разбогател?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:57.89,борщев,,0,0,0,,Нет, он зачесал себя до смерти в дурдоме.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:08:00.52,вшивая,,0,0,0,,Ой, да это же был мой двоюродный братец Гарри!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:02.81,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ладно. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.81,0:08:04.39,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ладно. ЛАДНО.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.39,0:08:08.11,мясник,,0,0,0,,Ты сейчас идешь домой и берешь своё такое - растакое растение и приносишь его сюда.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:11.32,мясник,,0,0,0,,И если мистер желтопуз скажет что это хотя бы приемлимо - остаёшься.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:13.65,мясник,,0,0,0,,Если нет - пойдёшь покорять Париж.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.65,0:08:18.65,сёма,,0,0,0,,Не беспокойтесь, вам понравится. вот увидите!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.47,0:08:36.84,RADIO,,0,0,0,,Это радио КРЭГ
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.84,0:08:39.68,RADIO,,0,0,0,,Вы слушали музыку для старых инвалидов
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:44.52,RADIO,,0,0,0,,дальше в программе - "палатная серенада"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.56,матя,,0,0,0,,Сёма, это ты?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.56,0:08:47.73,сёма,,0,0,0,,Да, ма!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:50.57,матя,,0,0,0,,Иди сюда, посмотри на мой язык!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:54.03,сёма,,0,0,0,,Но ма, я уже смотрел твой язык сегогдня!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:56.57,матя,,0,0,0,,И тебе не жалко свою больную мать?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:09:00.87,матя,,0,0,0,,Смеёшься над беднягой, у которой одна нога тут, а другая в гробу.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:01.99,сёма,,0,0,0,,Ма, я не хотел...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.99,0:09:03.08,матя,,0,0,0,,Ты никогда не хотел...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:05.58,матя,,0,0,0,,Ну давай уже, взгляни на мой язык.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:08.33,сёма,,0,0,0,,Язык как язык, мам. Они все одинаковые.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:12.63,матя,,0,0,0,,Ты уже заходил к доктору Мельникову? Узнал результаты теста?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.63,0:09:14.51,сёма,,0,0,0,,Да, он сказал, что с тобой всё в порядке.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.51,0:09:18.47,матя,,0,0,0,,Ох, этот мельников. Я думала, что он - \Nтот самый доктор, что всегда говорит правду.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.47,0:09:20.64,сёма,,0,0,0,,Он сказал, что ты хоть прям щас можешь идти играть за ЦСКА.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.72,матя,,0,0,0,,Он хочет, чтобы я сдохла!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:24.81,матя,,0,0,0,,Сто процентов он работает с гробовщиком.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:25.68,сёма,,0,0,0,,Ма, мне пора идти...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:30.98,матя,,0,0,0,,Я знаю, я... Моя болячка возвращается. Я чувствую её каждое утро после завтрака.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:35.03,сёма,,0,0,0,,Да, это когда ты пьёшь эти.... ЫААА!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:37.32,матя,,0,0,0,,Что там у тебя? Какой-то сюрприз для меня?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.66,сёма,,0,0,0,,Открой и посмотри.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:45.25,матя,,0,0,0,,Хыыы... АААА ХАХАА ХАХАА ХААХАХАА ХАХАХА ХА ХА!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.25,0:09:48.17,матя,,0,0,0,,Тот самый известный тоник доктора жидкое седло!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:51.92,матя,,0,0,0,,погоди-ка...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:58.59,матя,,0,0,0,,Пить или мазаться при боли, неврите, невралгии, мирени... 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:02.43,матя,,0,0,0,,Е-Если вас сбил грузовик, обращайтесь к специалисту. 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:07.77,матя,,0,0,0,,Содержание алкоголя 98%. ХЫХАА ХО-ХА-ХА-ХА-ХО!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:12.77,матя,,0,0,0,,Ох, Сёма, ты не представляешь что это для меня значит!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:24.79,матя,,0,0,0,,Оооо, я уже чувствую как тепло и исцеление расходятся по моему телу...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.95,сёма,,0,0,0,,Ладно, мам. Мне пора брать моё зелёное чудо и бежать обратно в магазин
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.95,0:10:30.25,матя,,0,0,0,,You mean that\Nlousy weed out in the kitchen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:33.84,сёма,,0,0,0,,Yeah. If Mr. Mushnick doesn't like it,\Nhe's gonna fire me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.05,0:10:38.76,матя,,0,0,0,,Apparently, my hearing is goin' out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:40.80,матя,,0,0,0,,I just had the faint impression...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:45.06,матя,,0,0,0,,that your job security depends on\Nwhat Muchnick thanks of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:47.97,сёма,,0,0,0,,It looks worse than it did this\Nmorning when I went to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.97,0:10:49.60,сёма,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew what to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:52.56,матя,,0,0,0,,Well, if you ask me,\NI'd pitch it out in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.56,0:10:55.19,матя,,0,0,0,,I don't like my house cluttered up\Nwith rotten vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.19,0:10:57.44,сёма,,0,0,0,,Look ma, I gotta hurry.\NCan I bring you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.44,0:11:00.70,матя,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, yeah.\NBring me the Evening News.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.70,0:11:03.74,матя,,0,0,0,,They're running a-a\Nself-diagnosis contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:05.91,матя,,0,0,0,,The winner gets to go to to Mayo Clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:07.66,сёма,,0,0,0,,- Ha, ha.\N- Bye, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:11.04,матя,,0,0,0,,Bye, son.\NI'll see you at the rosy edge of dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.58,0:11:15.21,матя,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ Drink to me only with thine eyes{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:16.88,матя,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ And I will...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:22.97,борщев,,0,0,0,,And put this on my bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.26,0:11:28.06,сёма,,0,0,0,,Here it is everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:29.52,сёма,,0,0,0,,What do you think of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:30.98,надя,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.19,надя,,0,0,0,,It sure is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.19,0:11:34.35,борщев,,0,0,0,,It looks delicious but\Ndon't you think it's kind of stale?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:36.23,сёма,,0,0,0,,I hasn't been feeling too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:37.61,мясник,,0,0,0,,You call that a fancy plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:40.53,мясник,,0,0,0,,It looks like it never spent\Nan healthy day in its entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.53,0:11:41.57,надя,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:43.03,надя,,0,0,0,,I like it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.03,0:11:45.03,мясник,,0,0,0,,You, you like even skunk cabbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.03,0:11:46.62,надя,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:48.49,надя,,0,0,0,,What kind of a plant is this, Seymour?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:49.87,сёма,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:53.12,сёма,,0,0,0,,I got the seeds from a Japanese gardener\Nover on Central Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:56.63,сёма,,0,0,0,,He found them in with an order he got\Nfrom a plantation next to a cranberry farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:57.67,мясник,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:12:00.46,мясник,,0,0,0,,Fine. You don't even know what\Nis this plant you're groing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, I gave it a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- What name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:06.89,мясник,,0,0,0,,What? You gave it a dirty\Nname you can't even mention it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:08.22,сёма,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:09.60,сёма,,0,0,0,,I named it Audrey Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:12.56,надя,,0,0,0,,You named it after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.60,0:12:13.64,надя,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.89,0:12:16.61,надя,,0,0,0,,That's the most exiting thing\Nanyone's ever done to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:17.90,борщев,,0,0,0,,You poor kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:19.36,мясник,,0,0,0,,I don't think it's so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:22.94,мясник,,0,0,0,,I should keep on spending\Nten dollars a week on your salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.94,0:12:23.82,надя,,0,0,0,,But Gravis...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.82,0:12:25.28,надя,,0,0,0,,he named it after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:27.66,мясник,,0,0,0,,I know and if they keep it\Nthey'll name it Mushnick's Folly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:30.24,мясник,,0,0,0,,because I'll be in jail\Nbecause of non-payment of taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:31.12,борщев,,0,0,0,,- Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:31.70,мясник,,0,0,0,,- Who? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:32.70,борщев,,0,0,0,,You. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:34.96,борщев,,0,0,0,,That's probably the only plant\Nof its kind in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:37.08,борщев,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize if Seymour can\Nnurse that thing back to health...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.13,0:12:39.04,борщев,,0,0,0,,you have people\Ncoming here from all over?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:40.21,мясник,,0,0,0,,- You think so, you Fouch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:41.34,борщев,,0,0,0,,- I know so, you Mushnick?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:43.13,борщев,,0,0,0,,That's all I'm saying on the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.13,0:12:46.18,борщев,,0,0,0,,Sod, I got to get home.\NMy wife's making gardenias for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.57,надя,,0,0,0,,- Good night, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:49.22,борщев,,0,0,0,,- Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:50.47,борщев,,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:52.72,борщев,,0,0,0,,Crazy about kosher flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.06,0:12:55.44,сёма,,0,0,0,,He's a nice man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:57.98,мясник,,0,0,0,,Maybe he knows what he's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.31,0:12:59.69,мясник,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's not so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.69,0:13:02.03,мясник,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what I'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.57,0:13:04.78,мясник,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you\Nand this Dumbell Jr. for a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.16,мясник,,0,0,0,,If you can nurse it back to health,\Nyou both can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:09.12,мясник,,0,0,0,,If you can't, you're both fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:11.03,сёма,,0,0,0,,Aw, gee.\NThank you, Mr. Mushnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:16.96,надя,,0,0,0,,Don't feel sad, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.50,0:13:20.34,сёма,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your pity on me Audrey,\NI'm not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.34,0:13:22.09,надя,,0,0,0,,Who says you're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.75,0:13:23.88,сёма,,0,0,0,,Everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:25.13,надя,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:28.80,надя,,0,0,0,,But I think you're a fine\Nfigurative of a man, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:33.89,надя,,0,0,0,,and I know that Audrey Jr. will be the\Nsweetest thing in the whole, wide world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:35.48,сёма,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:40.06,сёма,,0,0,0,,I've given it every kind of fancy\Nfertilizer and atomic plant food and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.11,0:13:43.73,сёма,,0,0,0,,distilled mineral water that you can buy\Nbut I just gets sicker and sicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:44.90,надя,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.36,0:13:47.82,надя,,0,0,0,,You're gonna be another\NLuther Glendale.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:48.86,сёма,,0,0,0,,Pasadena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.03,0:13:50.03,надя,,0,0,0,,Burbank.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:52.37,надя,,0,0,0,,Good night, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.16,сёма,,0,0,0,,G'night, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:04.84,сёма,,0,0,0,,What's the matter little plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:08.26,сёма,,0,0,0,,Haven't I done everything\NI could for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:10.22,сёма,,0,0,0,,Where did I goof?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:16.64,сёма,,0,0,0,,You're the first little plant I ever tried to\Ngrow, and if you die, I dunno what I'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:18.18,сёма,,0,0,0,,Please don't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:22.06,сёма,,0,0,0,,I'll get you some water, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:41.42,сёма,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:45.05,сёма,,0,0,0,,You opened up just like you do\Nevery night at sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.05,0:14:47.21,сёма,,0,0,0,,I wish I knew how to make you grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:50.76,сёма,,0,0,0,,Here, let me move this out of your way\Nso you can breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.01,сёма,,0,0,0,,Ow!\NOw, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.80,0:14:56.51,сёма,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.56,0:14:57.97,сёма,,0,0,0,,How come you woke up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:00.44,сёма,,0,0,0,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.64,0:15:02.02,сёма,,0,0,0,,You like blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.98,0:15:06.27,сёма,,0,0,0,,You must be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.28,0:15:08.28,сёма,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:18.95,сёма,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nwhat I'm doing for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.25,0:15:30.47,сёма,,0,0,0,,Aww, who could have thought it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:32.55,сёма,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.59,0:15:35.43,сёма,,0,0,0,,I guess there's just no accounting\Nfor people's taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.82,0:15:47.91,надя,,0,0,0,,- Seymour!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.91,0:15:48.90,мясник,,0,0,0,,- My boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:51.90,надя,,0,0,0,,You're the most magnanimous\Nperson in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.99,0:15:53.78,мясник,,0,0,0,,Look on him, Audrey.\NIsn't he beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:55.07,мясник,,0,0,0,,Isn't he delicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.28,0:15:57.03,мясник,,0,0,0,,Isn't he got a two dollar raise?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:58.45,мясник,,0,0,0,,What happened to your fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.49,0:15:59.62,сёма,,0,0,0,,Bee stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.79,сёма,,0,0,0,,So how come\NI'm all of a sudden so wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:03.67,мясник,,0,0,0,,Five bees?\NOne for each finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:04.79,сёма,,0,0,0,,Ten bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.83,0:16:06.58,сёма,,0,0,0,,Did you say I was\Ngetting a two dollar raise?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:08.50,мясник,,0,0,0,,Correct, my very excellent Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.55,0:16:09.19,мясник,,0,0,0,,- Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.19,0:16:10.63,сёма,,0,0,0,,- What did I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:12.55,надя,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:17.47,сёма,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!\NLook at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:19.10,сёма,,0,0,0,,It grew.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.81,сёма,,0,0,0,,It's almost a foot long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.93,0:16:22.31,надя,,0,0,0,,Isn't it empirical?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:25.02,мясник,,0,0,0,,It grows like a cold sore from the lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:29.77,мясник,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello young pretty ladies.\NWhat can Gravis Mushnick do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:31.99,девки,,0,0,0,,Well, we saw your sign outside.\NAbout the Audrey Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:33.95,девки,,0,0,0,,So we thought we'd come in and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.99,0:16:34.99,мясник,,0,0,0,,Well, give a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.03,0:16:37.91,надя,,0,0,0,,That makes four people today\Nwho come in just to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.95,0:16:41.49,девки,,0,0,0,,- Oh, dig Shirley.\N- Is that just too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.49,0:16:43.00,девки,,0,0,0,,Oh, what kind of plant is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.29,надя,,0,0,0,,It's an Audrey Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.29,0:16:46.25,мясник,,0,0,0,,How was it you got in\Ntrouble with ten bees?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:48.42,девки,,0,0,0,,Is that all?\NI mean, doesn't it have a scientific name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:49.63,мясник,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:50.75,мясник,,0,0,0,,But who could denounce it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.76,мясник,,0,0,0,,You would like maybe to buy something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:54.09,девки,,0,0,0,,Well, we don't have any money...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.80,девки,,0,0,0,,except 2000 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:16:58.39,девки,,0,0,0,,But that's just to spend on flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.43,0:16:59.97,девки,,0,0,0,,So we don't have any of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:01.01,девки,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a drag?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.01,0:17:03.22,мясник,,0,0,0,,You got t-t-t-two thousand dollars...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.27,0:17:05.31,мясник,,0,0,0,,just for to spend on flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:06.56,мясник,,0,0,0,,- Mhm.\N- That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.44,мясник,,0,0,0,,Who died?\NThe Chamber of Commerce?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:09.81,девки,,0,0,0,,We're all from Cucamonga high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.81,0:17:10.98,девки,,0,0,0,,We're building a float.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.02,0:17:13.19,девки,,0,0,0,,- For the Rose Bowl parade.\N- Which is made of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.23,0:17:15.11,девки,,0,0,0,,- Thousands of them.\N- And we're on the comittee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:17.99,девки,,0,0,0,,- That picks the florist.\N- And then glues on the flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:22.70,девки,,0,0,0,,- Gee, that sure is a mad plant.\N- Wow, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.29,надя,,0,0,0,,Seymour here invented it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.37,0:17:26.83,девки,,0,0,0,,- He didn't!\N- Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.83,мясник,,0,0,0,,Girls!\NGirls, girls, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.88,0:17:31.59,мясник,,0,0,0,,Please don't damage the horticulturalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.34,0:17:36.47,мясник,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how come you don't buy all these\Nthousands of flowers from Gravis Mushnick?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.76,0:17:39.30,мясник,,0,0,0,,My flowers got something the others don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:40.00,девки,,0,0,0,,- What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.00,0:17:40.76,сёма,,0,0,0,,- They're cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.76,0:17:41.76,девки,,0,0,0,,Well, cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:44.10,девки,,0,0,0,,If your shop is good enough\Nto develop the Audrey Jr...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:46.39,девки,,0,0,0,,- I guess it can get everything we need.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:48.14,девки,,0,0,0,,We'll talk it over with the\Nrest of the committee.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.14,0:17:48.68,мясник,,0,0,0,,- Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.68,0:17:49.94,девки,,0,0,0,,- We've got to run now. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.98,0:17:50.83,надя,,0,0,0,,- Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:51.69,сёма,,0,0,0,,- Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:53.07,мясник,,0,0,0,,Bye, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.24,мясник,,0,0,0,,A son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:00.16,мясник,,0,0,0,,A son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.24,мясник,,0,0,0,,Look, Audrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.49,0:18:03.20,мясник,,0,0,0,,I got a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.54,0:18:05.12,сёма,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, Mr Mushnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:06.08,мясник,,0,0,0,,What, Mr. Mushnick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:08.50,мясник,,0,0,0,,I don't want you should\Ncall me Mr. Mushnick anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.54,0:18:10.50,мясник,,0,0,0,,I want you should call me dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.09,сёма,,0,0,0,,Ok, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that beautiful?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.92,0:18:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour Krelborn...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,come over here, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.55,0:18:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to talk on you\Nabout the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.14,0:18:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look on this fly trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.05,0:18:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Look on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we got no more Skid Row.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be rich.\NUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I am building for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,a giant greenhouse in which you are\Nmaking impossible flowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,which in turn I am selling\Nat ridiculous prices...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.61,0:18:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,in my giant new flower saloon\Nin Beverly Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.16,0:18:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that big sign in the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.41,0:18:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It is saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gravis Mushnick", in French.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.41,0:18:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it exciting?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.17,0:18:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll have an orchestra\Nright by the cash register,...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.38,0:18:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and Gravis will wave his arms...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.25,0:18:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and the orchestra will play\NMendelssohn's Spring Song.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:19:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll come out in a gown,\Nwrapped by someone expensive and say:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"The carnations are\N600 dollars a dozen,"...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.10,0:19:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"two dozen for a thousand."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.35,0:19:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's a bargain!\N- Get 'em while they last
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop shouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My uncle Moishen's brother Yankel\Njust passed away in New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,how much are the carnations today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.94,0:19:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The carnations are 600 dollars a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.20,0:19:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are they\Nletting him run around loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.49,0:19:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.\NPlease excuse my son, Mrs. Shiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.04,0:19:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Just point anything in the store\Nand it is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.37,0:19:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.66,0:19:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- The cash register, maybe, huh?\N- Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.83,0:19:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are several dozen carnations...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,on the house courtesey of\NGravis Mushnick, the bloom tycoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's my dad.\N- Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.26,0:19:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Only, tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only did my uncle Moishe's brother\NYankel die...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.19,0:19:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,in New Jersey...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,we should also give some flowers\Nto that poor dead plant there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mr. Mushnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.66,0:20:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Mrs. Shiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what happened to my plant, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.91,0:20:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you calling dad?\NWho? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- It was so beautiful just a few seconds ago.\N- Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.83,0:20:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few seconds ago I gave\Naway dozens of carnations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Free!\NTo Mrs. Shiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You have perhaps an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.72,0:20:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but if you give me a minute\NI'll think of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it all now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.76,0:20:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in the poorhouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The big sign in the sky\Nit is reading:
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.98,0:20:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"Seymour Krelborn.\NRest in Peace."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.27,0:20:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In Arabic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've got to give him another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.65,0:20:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised me a week, Mr. Mushnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.78,0:20:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd sit up all night with that plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be healthy in the morning,\Nyou'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.87,0:20:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feed meeee.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feed meeee.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feed meeee!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.81,0:21:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mhm.\NFeed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.11,0:21:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.15,0:21:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.78,0:21:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a talking plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Say it again.\N- Feed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.62,0:21:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been to college and\NI ain't been around much...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.21,0:21:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but I would be willing to bet there\Nain't no such thing as a talking plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, Junior,\NI'd-I'd like to feed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.59,0:21:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've used up all my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.55,0:21:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeeeeeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.51,0:21:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me,\NI'm all cut to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.97,0:21:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe I can find\Nanother drop here someplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the best I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,More!\NMore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.91,0:22:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm already anaemic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.33,0:22:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Junior,...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.37,0:22:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to give you anything I got...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,but I gotta keep a little blood for\Nmyself or I'll be in worse shape than ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.09,0:22:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go for a walk.\NMaybe I'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.63,0:25:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.59,0:25:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.68,0:25:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, chow-hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.68,0:25:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother me.\NI got problems of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.14,0:25:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.81,0:25:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sorry, pal. I am fresh out of blood.\NTalk to somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.77,0:25:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.65,0:25:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I am knocked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.15,0:25:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I just killed a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.02,0:25:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.73,0:25:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Think it's fun to be a murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.49,0:25:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You think it's fun to...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.74,0:25:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,haul around a sack full of...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.24,0:25:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,fooooood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.28,0:25:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, Junior!\NWhat kind of guy do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.49,0:25:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.13,0:25:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe just a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.01,0:26:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What you call that salad?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.32,0:26:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Nefarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.36,0:26:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, before the next course...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll have a nice cigar.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.07,0:26:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.62,0:26:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You would like maybe a cigar?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.20,0:26:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ha-ha-ha.\N- Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.62,0:26:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you don't smoke cigars, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.75,0:26:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I thinking about?\NWhere are the matches?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.09,0:26:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I found?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.88,0:26:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for the matches...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.05,0:26:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And I found I left the\Nmoney in the red suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.35,0:26:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your mock chicken leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.39,0:26:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any money?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.39,0:26:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So what else is new?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.15,0:26:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.\NAlright!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.69,0:26:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.94,0:26:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, a man is entitled.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.36,0:26:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on. This is your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.32,0:26:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait for the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.95,0:27:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get smart with me, girlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.37,0:27:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have you know that in my shop\Nin the cash register...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.28,0:27:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having the total day's receipts...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.04,0:27:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,which is summing up\Nto more than nine dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.83,0:27:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll bring the rest of the food...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.50,0:27:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll go the the\Nshop and get the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.38,0:27:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You are playing my favorite song.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.88,0:27:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, look here, buster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.55,0:27:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One of you is gonna go down\Nright now and get the loot...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.34,0:27:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,while the other one stays here\Nuntil the first one gets back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.35,0:27:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.18,0:27:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.27,0:27:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In this fancy schmancy restaurant\Nyou are holding hostages, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.15,0:27:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.48,0:27:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.57,0:27:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You eat up, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.57,0:27:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back in a flash\Nwith the cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.11,0:27:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Gravis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.51,0:28:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ 'tis the season to be jolly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.68,0:28:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ Fa-la-la-la-la,\Nla-la-la-la-la-la-la.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.56,0:28:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ 'tis the season to be jolly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.73,0:28:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ Fa-la-la-la{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.81,0:28:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ La-la-la{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.86,0:28:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ 'tis the season{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.11,0:28:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ To be jolly{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.07,0:28:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ Fa-la-la-la{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.74,0:28:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}♪ La-la-la{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.75,0:28:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're flush now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.04,0:28:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me whiskey, rum, wine, gin, bourbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- Scotch, rye, tequila, sake, manishevitz
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.59,0:28:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you bring the money?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.88,0:28:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mock me with the money.\NI got to get drunk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.18,0:28:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- I don't know.\N- Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.72,0:28:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it.\NBring me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.77,0:28:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring everything. Creme de menthe.\NEverything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravis?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.73,0:28:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- What happened?\N- Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.56,0:29:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you've seen a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.02,0:29:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghosts I could handle.\NDon't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.44,0:29:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell me?\NMaybe I could help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.07,0:29:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Help, you couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.11,0:29:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Try and eat something.\NIt'll calm your agrimation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.49,0:29:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In mine own shop...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.66,0:29:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Audrey, you wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.71,0:29:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd break out and tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.17,0:29:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.29,0:29:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow.\NRight after I am telling the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.09,0:29:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But Mushnick didn't come to the police.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If he had...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.97,0:29:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}that might have been the\Nfinish of the unhappy story.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.76,0:29:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.24,0:29:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Gravis.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.66,0:29:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,85 dollars worth of business\Nalready, and we've barely opened!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.04,0:29:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.08,0:30:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be interested in selling\Na half-interest to this place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.46,0:30:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mr. Mushnick.\N- We talked to the comittee.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.42,0:30:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- And they said we could use your flowers.\N- On the float.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.88,0:30:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- And guess what?\N- We're going to feature Audrey Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.51,0:30:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right on top.\N- Can't you just picture it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.01,0:30:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can picture it.\N- Oh, won't the people just eat it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.68,0:30:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.06,0:30:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're gonna have\Nthe big part of it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.06,0:30:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Of course she can fit in it.\N- Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.39,0:30:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- The queen.\N- With her crown and scepter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.90,0:30:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.27,0:30:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, you could just eat her up.\N- Eat up the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.90,0:30:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's Seymour!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Seymour!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.24,0:30:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow!\NI got a toothache.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.70,0:30:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, I got a toothache.\NReally, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.28,0:30:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.33,0:30:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come with me.\N- I got a toothache! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.66,0:30:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, let go of my jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.75,0:30:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, my jaw.\NOw, ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.21,0:30:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Owwww.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.58,0:30:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.88,0:30:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.88,0:30:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a toothache.\NWhat do you wanna talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.88,0:30:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That plant.\NIs that a nice subject for to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.05,0:30:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The plant is great, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.47,0:30:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,it's it's four times\Nbigger than it was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.01,0:30:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw, I saw.\NHow come the plant is now so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.47,0:30:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.43,0:30:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But look at them people out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.35,0:31:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We only been open a half hour we already\Ndone 70 dollars worth of business.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.56,0:31:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,85.\NNow look, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave this plant a fancy name:\NAudrey Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.99,0:31:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I want to know right now\Nwhat do just people call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.20,0:31:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,well it's a cross between a butterworth\Nand a venus flytrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.49,0:31:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus flytrap!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are the habbits\Nof this Venus flytrap?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.83,0:31:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the book says it eats insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.66,0:31:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It eats them three times in it's life...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.75,0:31:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- and then it's full grown.\N- Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.79,0:31:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And how many times is this one eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.42,0:31:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.88,0:31:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Once or twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.34,0:31:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.22,0:31:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is kind of an\Nunusual type flytrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.01,0:31:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.85,0:31:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It may never eat again.\NI don't see how it could get any bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.14,0:31:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you think it don't\Nneed any more flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.90,0:31:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.44,0:31:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, my tooth is just killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.\NExcellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.11,0:31:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You run along to the dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.20,0:31:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.20,0:31:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.87,0:32:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravis!\NWe got to order more flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.08,0:32:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tons of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.42,0:32:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm making lots of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.52,0:32:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Argh!\NArgh! Argh!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.44,0:32:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please don't hurt!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.98,0:32:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please don't hurt me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.61,0:32:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Argh!\NArgh!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.24,0:32:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That'll teach you to keep your\Nbill up to date, you deadbeat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.82,0:32:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Argh! Argh!\NArgh!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.21,0:32:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then run,\Nyou snivelling dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.92,0:32:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad, I hurt you.\NI'm glad. I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.75,0:32:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.88,0:32:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymore.\NGot a bad tooth, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.67,0:32:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I thought this\Nwas the men's room!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.22,0:32:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour, come back here, you bad dog.\NYou get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.05,0:33:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you are the young man\Nwho ruined my gladiolas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.64,0:33:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.68,0:33:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.27,0:33:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- My tooth stopped hurting.\N- My tooth stopped hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.03,0:33:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.24,0:33:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.74,0:33:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.36,0:33:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.62,0:33:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.99,0:33:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Argh!\N- Does that hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.62,0:33:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah!\N- Good. You haven't felt anything yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.21,0:33:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ah-ha.\N- It's this one over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.75,0:33:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour.\NWho is the dentist here, you or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.30,0:33:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find that tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.71,0:33:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,M-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.80,0:33:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.59,0:33:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that stalagmite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.51,0:33:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.\NIt's going to be an easy one, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.22,0:33:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't even use Novocaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.85,0:33:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, you poked the mirror in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.06,0:33:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't tell me about it, stupid.\NJust swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.40,0:33:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.\NHere's the thing now, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.27,0:33:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll have this one\Nand this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.98,0:33:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and that one and I\Nhave to have this one, Seymour!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.99,0:33:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only one tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.28,0:33:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour, who is the dentist here,...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.36,0:34:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,.. you or me? Are you practising\Ndentistry without a license?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.99,0:34:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Alright\N- Uh-hu.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.79,0:34:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.21,0:34:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit!\NSeymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.67,0:34:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}- ♪ Seymour, don't be...{\i0}\N- Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.00,0:34:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.25,0:34:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.38,0:34:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you look at that, Seymour?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.30,0:34:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were an elk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.18,0:34:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.68,0:34:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.85,0:34:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't afford an assistant,...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.01,0:34:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so I get this ready instant mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.35,0:34:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't last very long\Nbut it tastes good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.56,0:34:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.44,0:34:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.23,0:34:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,See? You're trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.44,0:34:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A duel! Ah-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.71,0:34:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this doctor's office?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.46,0:34:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:34:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.01,0:35:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I...\Nyou-you can come in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.02,0:35:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Wilbur Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.19,0:35:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilburforce what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.99,0:35:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.53,0:35:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wilbur Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.66,0:35:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My first name is Wilbur,\Nmy last name is Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.83,0:35:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.45,0:35:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you have an appointment, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.66,0:35:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a middle name well you have\Nan appointment may be no but you were
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.00,0:35:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,one of your patients.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.29,0:35:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A Mrs. S. Shiva.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.13,0:35:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I do a lot of undertaking\Nfor her relatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.97,0:35:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as you could see,\NI have a customer now...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.55,0:35:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm all booked up for the rest of\Nthe day, so you have to come back tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.47,0:35:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I couldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.14,0:35:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I have three or four abscesses...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.14,0:35:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,a touch of pyorrhea...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.56,0:35:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,nine or ten cavities...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.23,0:35:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my pivot tooth\Nand I'm in terrible pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.23,0:35:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I-I can't help you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.32,0:36:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.11,0:36:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go just wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.29,0:36:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The patient came to me with a\Nlarge hole in his abdomen...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.71,0:36:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,caused by a fire poker\Nused on him by his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.09,0:36:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,He almost bled to death\Nand gangrene had set in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.68,0:36:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't give me much of a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.10,0:36:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There were other complications.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.14,0:36:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The man had cancer,\Ntuberculosis, leprosy...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.90,0:36:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and a touch of the grippe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.81,0:36:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided to operate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.69,0:36:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My... my patient just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.90,0:36:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You cou... you could come in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.82,0:36:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh goodie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.49,0:36:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't see the other man leave.\N- Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.24,0:36:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,he went out the back door
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.71,0:36:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, most people don't\Nlike to go to the dentist...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.50,0:37:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I rather enjoy it myself, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.71,0:37:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean there is such...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.92,0:37:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a real feeling of growth,\Nof...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.51,0:37:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,of...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.18,0:37:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,progress when that...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.89,0:37:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that old drill goes in...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.89,0:37:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'd almost rather go to the\Ndentist than anywhere, wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.89,0:37:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.85,0:37:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, no Novocaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.36,0:37:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It dulls the senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.07,0:37:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna hurt you more than it is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.53,0:37:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodie goodie, here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.07,0:37:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.03,0:37:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.99,0:37:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.54,0:37:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, don't stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.79,0:37:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I made a lot of holes...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.13,0:37:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and now I've gotta\Nfill it with this silver stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you gonna pull any?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.84,0:37:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, uh...\N- Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.84,0:37:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.02,0:37:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.27,0:38:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.90,0:38:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.19,0:38:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Dr. Farb...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.70,0:38:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it's been quite an afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.82,0:38:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I can truly say\NI've never enjoyed myself so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.37,0:38:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll recommend you to all my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.08,0:38:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NBye.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.25,0:38:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.34,0:38:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.43,0:38:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, take it easy, Dracula.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.72,0:38:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think I'm carrying here?\NMy dirty laundry?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.14,0:38:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feed!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.35,0:38:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!\NI'm coming already.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.69,0:38:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be enough for anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.11,0:38:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.15,0:38:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Fooood.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.95,0:38:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, goodbye Dr. Farb.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.46,0:39:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have been a crummy dentist\Nbut you were a nice fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.67,0:39:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I never meant to kill\Nanybody in my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.96,0:39:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I killed two in the last two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.42,0:39:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he asked for it coming\Nat me with that knife and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.59,0:39:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, Dr Farb.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Want anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.31,0:39:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[BURP]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.35,0:39:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[BURP]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.10,0:39:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,See you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.21,0:39:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.17,0:39:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.09,0:39:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the wife, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.25,0:39:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not bad, Joe.\N- Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.26,0:39:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- The kids?\N- Lost one yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.01,0:39:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Awful, eh?\NHow did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.80,0:39:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing with matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.18,0:39:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, those are the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.55,0:39:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.89,0:39:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a strange one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.14,0:40:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Railroad people say the last one of their\Nbest detectives the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.77,0:40:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.73,0:40:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Down by the yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.85,0:40:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He was watching refrigerator cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.73,0:40:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Refrigerator cars?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.44,0:40:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ice thieves.\N- Oh yeah? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.69,0:40:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.69,0:40:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Vanished, right on the tracks.\N- Clues?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.40,0:40:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.45,0:40:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.57,0:40:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Dentist. Farb.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.16,0:40:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dead?\N- Missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.83,0:40:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Clues?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.04,0:40:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Blood in the office.\N- Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.50,0:40:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Skid Row.\N- Ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.96,0:40:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- None.\N- Check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.08,0:40:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.22,0:40:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now we were on the case,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.09,0:40:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}officer Frank Stoolie and me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.43,0:40:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My name is Fink.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.43,0:40:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sergeant Joe Fink.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.56,0:40:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm a fink.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.83,0:41:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Mr Mushnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.25,0:41:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.59,0:41:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.46,0:41:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ain't it something?\N- It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.84,0:41:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's monstrositous!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.84,0:41:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.34,0:41:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And to think that you did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.39,0:41:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, Audrey. You don't have to kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.89,0:41:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you like me to kiss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.10,0:41:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...\Nyou don't like to kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.86,0:41:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.32,0:41:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody else ever did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.32,0:41:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I do like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.82,0:41:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You do? You really do?\NYou like to kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.11,0:41:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.03,0:41:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Would... would you like to kiss me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.99,0:41:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.03,0:41:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That plant...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.37,0:41:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy! You kiss good, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.25,0:41:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess I just have a good kisser.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.63,0:41:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,H-h-h-how d-d-did...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.50,0:41:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to go out on\Na date with me some night?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.84,0:41:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- When...?\N- Oh, sure I would, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.01,0:41:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- Any time.\N- Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.01,0:41:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.43,0:42:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, boy!\N- A-a-a-about that plant...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.85,0:42:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- We got the list.\N- Of flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.31,0:42:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- For the float.\N- For the rose parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.35,0:42:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't talk to you now, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.56,0:42:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk on Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.69,0:42:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- We got the list.\N- With the float.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.48,0:42:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's ok. Let's take a look at it.\N- Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.36,0:42:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, what's cookin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.48,0:42:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at my plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.78,0:42:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- My, what a large one.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.62,0:42:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mrs. Shiva. What's new?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.87,0:42:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oy, I got terrible news.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.54,0:42:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,My nephew Frankie just lost his little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.29,0:42:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.71,0:42:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.75,0:42:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He was playing with matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.55,0:42:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to buy, maybe, some flowers?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.63,0:42:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah... about 50 cents worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.88,0:42:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll get the for you.\NLook at my plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.01,0:42:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.39,0:42:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your name Gravis Mushnick?\N- M-M-Mushnick, Gravis. That's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.52,0:42:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just want to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.69,0:42:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Questions ask me why?\N- Just want to ask a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.90,0:42:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.19,0:42:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do what?\N- Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.57,0:42:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever see this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.45,0:43:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Man... see... picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.03,0:43:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.03,0:43:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a guilty conscience?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.07,0:43:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Why should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.41,0:43:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever see this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.20,0:43:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Man... see... this-this picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.04,0:43:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Farb.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.16,0:43:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- So you know him?\N- He's my dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.79,0:43:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He... eh... maybe did something?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.08,0:43:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- He disappeared.\N- Blood in his office.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.67,0:43:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Another man, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.59,0:43:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood on the railroad tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.13,0:43:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dr. Farb is murdered?\N- Is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.88,0:43:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows? Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.89,0:43:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.60,0:43:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.14,0:43:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, Mushnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.31,0:43:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hear anything about these men...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.89,0:43:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,call our office.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.85,0:43:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll be glad to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.52,0:43:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,cooperate with the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.69,0:43:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, aunt Siddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.73,0:43:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, isn't it terrible what\Nhappened to your boy, Frankie?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.78,0:43:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.78,0:43:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.83,0:43:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you tell me if this plant\Nis finished all grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.95,0:43:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's finished all growning up.\N- You wouldn't kid your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.42,0:43:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- My father came home?\N- Me, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.21,0:43:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a finger of speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.79,0:43:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now look...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.84,0:43:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand anymore that plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.09,0:44:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's growing me out of house and home.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.88,0:44:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't gonna grow anymore. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.84,0:44:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.85,0:44:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It ate three times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.72,0:44:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who...\NI mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.18,0:44:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,what did it eat this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.39,0:44:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, abou...\Nabout a million Japanese beetles.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.27,0:44:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't eat no more?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.98,0:44:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's full.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.07,0:44:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gravis?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.65,0:44:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lady from some kind\Nof a committance outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.24,0:44:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.95,0:44:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.99,0:44:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,By the by...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.58,0:44:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand you want to take\NAudrey out on a date tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.62,0:44:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very good with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.21,0:44:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I am staying to keep an\Neye on that meshugana plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.96,0:44:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where are we gonna go tonight, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.30,0:44:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I-I just remembered:\NI don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.26,0:44:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.80,0:44:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We could take a walk along\Nthe ocean or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.47,0:44:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a great idea.\NWe could eat dinner at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.85,0:44:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- My mom's a great cook.\N- Oh, that's swell!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.35,0:44:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy, I'll call later and tell her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.31,0:44:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.15,0:45:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.49,0:45:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You like?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.62,0:45:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I neither like nor dislike\Nanything, my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I happen to represent the society of...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Silent Flower Observers\Nof Southern California.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.21,0:45:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.96,0:45:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.13,0:45:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,who created this magnificent bloom?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.68,0:45:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I did. Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.05,0:45:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.93,0:45:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,A-a-and what might your name be?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.22,0:45:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour Krelborn, with a K.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.48,0:45:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Krelboind?\N- Krelborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.81,0:45:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Raised in the coffee can.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.27,0:45:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.48,0:45:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.40,0:45:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Mr. Krelboind...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.53,0:45:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a freak or can more\Nbe raised from the seeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.82,0:45:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We should live so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.99,0:45:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think there gonna\Nbe will be any more, Miss, uh,...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.45,0:45:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Feuchtwanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.45,0:45:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs Hortense Feuchtwanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.37,0:45:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think this is gonna be the only one,\NMrs. Fishswinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.12,0:45:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Feuchtwanger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.79,0:45:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Feuchtwanger?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.92,0:46:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's probably indigestible anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.84,0:46:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.51,0:46:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the honour to tell you,\NSeymour Krelboind,...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.18,0:46:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,that you have been selected\Nto receive the annual trophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.72,0:46:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Society of Silent Flower\NObservers of Southern California.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A trophy? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.94,0:46:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Such is justice...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.23,0:46:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But tell me: When do you suppose\Nthose large buds will open?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.32,0:46:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well according to what the book says\Nabout the plants that I crossed...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.61,0:46:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,they should open the\Nday after tomorrow at sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.16,0:46:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.41,0:46:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall return at that\Ntime to present the trophy
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.91,0:46:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.71,0:46:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.42,0:46:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy!\NI'm gonna get a trophy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.51,0:46:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Seymour. I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.51,0:46:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a real trophy for Audrey Jr.!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.35,0:46:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- We'll put it on the float.\N- In the rose parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.60,0:46:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.60,0:47:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.\NI-I'm a terrible sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.82,0:47:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm a complete sea hag.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.73,0:47:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- She always says that.\N- O, well, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.78,0:47:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't been feelin' very well lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.03,0:47:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Audrey, this is my ma, Winifred Krelborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.53,0:47:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma, this is Audrey Fulquard.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.20,0:47:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.12,0:47:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi Audrey. Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.95,0:47:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I sure am. I could eat a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.96,0:47:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Well, sit right down,\Nand I'll go get the first course.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.17,0:47:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit here, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.42,0:47:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You want me to take your sweater?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.84,0:47:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.52,0:47:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.89,0:47:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.19,0:47:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes like cough syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.07,0:47:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Phlegm's cough syrup
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.32,0:47:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.62,0:47:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- To Audrey Jr.!\N- No, to Audrey Sr.!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.98,0:48:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You! You glutton, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.40,0:48:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tonight I keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.94,0:48:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't let nobody get near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.04,0:48:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.00,0:48:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't touch it till I\Nget a little flavouring.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.63,0:48:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.67,0:48:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure look good by candlelight.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.88,0:48:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I really, Seymour?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.51,0:48:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.18,0:48:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now try.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.01,0:48:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure smells different.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.47,0:48:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.85,0:49:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Some kind of oil, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.85,0:49:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cod liver oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.60,0:49:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful for the colon.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.15,0:49:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's sulphur powder on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.49,0:49:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.28,0:49:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.79,0:49:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm hungry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.47,0:49:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.63,0:49:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feed me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.47,0:49:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.89,0:49:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feed me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.14,0:49:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.06,0:49:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want food.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.52,0:49:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A talking plant we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.40,0:49:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm hungry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.78,0:49:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.15,0:49:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.65,0:49:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And other fine kettle von fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.78,0:50:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would you like to have tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.49,0:50:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You look fat enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.41,0:50:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We not only got a talking plant,\Nwe got one that makes with smart cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.67,0:50:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you listen to me, you botanical bum?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.05,0:50:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Food you wouldn't get.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.76,0:50:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not from Gravis Mushnick.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.38,0:50:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starved.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.09,0:50:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.68,0:50:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You would unpopulate all Skid Row.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.14,0:50:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.02,0:50:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.02,0:50:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't get fed from\NGravis mushnick tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.27,0:50:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.86,0:50:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.74,0:50:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I kinda like this chow mein.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.62,0:50:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, if it tastes a little bitter...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.12,0:50:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it's because it's made\Nof Chinese herbs and it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.33,0:50:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,flavored with accra myosin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.04,0:50:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Epsom salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.50,0:50:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't another cook in\Nthe whole world like my ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.92,0:50:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what your old man said\Nbefore the last ran out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.63,0:50:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, if you're gonna be\Nmarried, you gotta be a good cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.05,0:51:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.89,0:51:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You thinkin' to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.10,0:51:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- He hasn't asked me yet.\N- Who hasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.68,0:51:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.89,0:51:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour's too young to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.81,0:51:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Look here. A boy's got to go\Nand play around a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.15,0:51:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out on the makin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.36,0:51:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.65,0:51:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, ma. I don't wanna have a ball.\NI wanna be with Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.57,0:51:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now look, Seymour.\N- Oh, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.49,0:51:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You promised you wouldn't get married\Nuntil you bought me an iron lung.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.41,0:51:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been breathing for years, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.41,0:51:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it ain't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.83,0:51:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't easy, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.48,0:51:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.15,0:51:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Black cats, 13th job...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.23,0:51:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Friday 13th. Stupid superstition.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.03,0:52:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.07,0:52:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.62,0:52:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.24,0:52:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm old and sick.\NI wouldn't hurt even a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.29,0:52:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out in the light where I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.58,0:52:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.63,0:52:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.88,0:52:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.00,0:52:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. I'm only Gravis Mushnick.\NYou wouldn't want to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.46,0:52:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where would you hide the body?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.05,0:52:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm not gonna shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Not unless you try something.\N- Try something?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.09,0:52:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I never tried anything in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.97,0:52:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't try anything now.\NYou want my money? Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.35,0:52:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You want I should go out and steal you\Nsome more? That's alright, too. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.02,0:52:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.40,0:52:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I like your brand of hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.36,0:52:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll excuse it isn't more.\NI'm only a poor florist
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.94,0:52:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.15,0:52:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You got about 30 bucks here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.32,0:52:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now. Where's the rest of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.99,0:52:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in here this afternoon.\NI saw about 30,000 people in here...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.33,0:52:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have spent\Nsome money. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.79,0:52:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't no more money.\NThey came in to look on the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.00,0:52:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a big attraction.\NAudrey Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.50,0:52:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The plant. Don't try to snow me, Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.54,0:52:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,30,000 square didn't come\Nin just to look for a plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.67,0:53:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.80,0:53:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't got no more money.\NHonest. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.13,0:53:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, let's try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.47,0:53:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,One...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.68,0:53:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Two...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.76,0:53:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.89,0:53:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Four...\N- I ain't got no more money, honest!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.47,0:53:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Try it the other way around.\NFive...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.85,0:53:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.89,0:53:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.94,0:53:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Two...\N- Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.06,0:53:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.23,0:53:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, big bad. Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.32,0:53:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,In the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.32,0:53:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,In the plant?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.24,0:53:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The big plant, Audrey Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.58,0:53:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I-inside the big leaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.29,0:53:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.08,0:53:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,H-h-how do you get it open?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.63,0:53:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.06,0:53:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In there?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.10,0:53:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.90,0:53:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.15,0:54:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,In the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.32,0:54:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.07,0:54:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Way inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.95,0:54:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Right at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.58,0:54:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.72,0:54:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.22,0:54:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about you got\Na date with Audrey tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.02,0:54:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no more sitting up\Nwith that no-goodnik plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.31,0:54:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But, see, Mr. Mushnick,\Nyou don't have to sit up with it any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.98,0:54:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's all grown up now.\N- Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.11,0:54:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Smart guy. How do you know\Nit don't be hungry no more?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.86,0:54:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well because...\N- Tonight you are staying!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.36,0:54:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tomorrow they are coming and\Nthey are going to give you a trophy...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.87,0:54:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and then after that we are getting\Nrid once and for all for that plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.08,0:55:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- Getting rid of it? Why?\N- Don't ask. Why? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.21,0:55:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The end. Into the garbage can.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.13,0:55:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aloha.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.63,0:55:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi.\NYes, Mrs. Shiva?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.96,0:55:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.17,0:55:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wonderful plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.84,0:55:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's alright, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.34,0:55:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grow other plants,\Neven more wonderful ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.97,0:55:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.97,0:55:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you figure out what\Nwe're doing tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.43,0:55:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah we're going to place\Nfull of beautiful flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.73,0:55:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- We have to stay here.\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.02,0:55:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, never mind. We'll have a picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.48,0:55:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be just like going to the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.40,0:55:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, boy!\N{\i1}- Flowers and...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.74,0:55:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and pink azaleas, for the arbour,...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.32,0:55:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- and the 9000 yellow mons for the...\N- For the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.32,0:55:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- And the... the roses\N- I got them around the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.79,0:55:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you're going to a\Npicnic at night with that Fulquard girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.62,0:55:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you like Audrey, ma?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.13,0:55:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She's out after your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.84,0:55:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.17,0:55:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's a smart one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.30,0:55:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll latch onto ya till ya get\Nsome and then goodbye, fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.55,0:55:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But Audrey's honest girl, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.51,0:55:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, never trust a woman who's too healthy
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.77,0:56:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But Audrey had a bad cold a few weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.14,0:56:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, cold, a puny cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.77,0:56:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get yourself\Na real female with...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.90,0:56:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,something decent like...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.32,0:56:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,pneumonoconiosis, or-or gall stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.98,0:56:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe she could\Ncatch something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.90,0:56:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing she'll catch is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.03,0:56:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And she'll take you off to\Nsome shady sanatorium...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.83,0:56:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and leave me to\Nchiropractors and faith healers.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.70,0:56:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I know when I'm not wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.71,0:56:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.33,0:56:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't feel sorry for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.88,0:56:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just find a nice,\Nwet alley somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.67,0:56:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and curl up and wait for the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.97,0:56:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't die till I get\Nback, will you ma?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.64,0:56:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of you.\NI'll always take care of you, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.18,0:56:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.81,0:56:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, Audrey, I've never\Ntasted food like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.61,0:56:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a peanut butter and jelly sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.94,0:56:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Peanut butter and jelly -\Nwhat does that cure?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.36,0:56:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. It's just a food.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.24,0:56:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What good is it if it\Ndoesn't clear up pimples...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.16,0:56:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,or shrink your sinus\Ntissues or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.24,0:57:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just being silly, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.79,0:57:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour, what do you wanna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.71,0:57:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wanna grow things.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had a lot of money,\NI'd go to the South Seas,..
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.84,0:57:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where they grow the most\Nfabulous plants in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.30,0:57:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.22,0:57:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.26,0:57:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to go to the South Seas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.76,0:57:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason why you couldn't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.31,0:57:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you take me with you, Seymour?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.31,0:57:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I couldn't very well\Ngo without you, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.27,0:57:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.77,0:57:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.02,0:57:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm in love with you, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.82,0:57:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm in love with you, too, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.90,0:57:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feed me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.15,0:57:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.32,0:57:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...\NI'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.78,0:57:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm hungry!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.58,0:57:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.74,0:57:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- I didn't mean it.\N- Why did you say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.33,0:57:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh.\NFood.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.50,0:57:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't even say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.83,0:57:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes I did.\NI said it. I said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.59,0:57:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm looking right at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.67,0:57:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm a ventriloquist.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.80,0:57:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.63,0:57:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- A ventrilo...\N{\i1}- Feed me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.59,0:58:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour, do you feel all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.30,0:58:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know.\NI'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.56,0:58:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then stop all this\Nnonsense and kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.23,0:58:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm dying from hunger!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.52,0:58:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, if you're so\Nhungry, eat something but...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.36,0:58:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.61,0:58:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gee, I'm sorry, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.65,0:58:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Give me to eat!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.49,0:58:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't control\Nyourself, I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.03,0:58:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need some chow.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.28,0:58:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, my empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.91,0:58:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Audrey, please wait.\NListen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.33,0:58:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've listened to all the\Nnonsense I wanna hear, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.46,0:58:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a nut.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.59,0:58:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You tell me that you love me and then\Nyou you act like a complete idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.09,0:58:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Please listen, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.68,0:58:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to explain everything soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.97,0:58:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you explain now?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.51,0:58:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Because so many things are so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.10,0:58:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.35,0:58:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But I gotta take care of mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.39,0:58:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that plant in there is\Ngonna make it all come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.77,0:58:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow they're gonna give me\Na trophy and I'll be famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.40,0:58:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a big botanist.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.36,0:58:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we can go to the South\NSeas just like we planned and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.07,0:59:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't have anything\Nto do with what went on in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.87,0:59:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're ready to come to your\Nsenses, Seymour,...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.54,0:59:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'll talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.58,0:59:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.46,0:59:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Feed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.93,0:59:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting pretty tired of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.80,0:59:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.76,0:59:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.10,0:59:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what you've done to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.39,0:59:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You not only made a butcher outta\Nme, you drove my girl away.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.27,0:59:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, and bring on the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.23,0:59:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me to shut up - you shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.86,0:59:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who raised you from a\Nbunch of little seeds?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.82,0:59:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who fed you all them high-class fertilizers\Nand sat up with you when you were sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.03,0:59:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Nodody else would have done that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.87,0:59:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You think anybody else would have\Nbrought you human beings to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.16,0:59:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Darm right, they wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.87,0:59:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've helped you and you've helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.58,0:59:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Now shut your trap and go to sleep.\NI'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.00,0:59:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Krelborn!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.71,0:59:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.09,0:59:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Close your eyes.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.34,1:00:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You are asleep.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.26,1:00:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.89,1:00:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you will do as I say.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.22,1:00:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you follow me?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.64,1:00:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.10,1:00:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You will go out and\Nfind me some food!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.77,1:00:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.15,1:00:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now begone.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.99,1:00:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And waste no time.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.34,1:00:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Idiot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.80,1:01:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Leonora Clyde.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.47,1:01:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the rain on the rhubarb?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.68,1:01:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Master is hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.19,1:01:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, hello there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.97,1:02:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find food for master.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.98,1:02:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Food I gotta find for master.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.94,1:02:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,For master I gotta find food.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.69,1:02:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can help.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.07,1:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who're you?\N- My name is Leonora Clyde.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.78,1:02:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.32,1:02:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Master wants food.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.58,1:02:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the old goat wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.29,1:02:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The night is young and so are we.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.87,1:02:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Master doesn't eat goat.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.13,1:02:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well what kind of food does he like?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.68,1:02:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.59,1:02:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's more like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.01,1:02:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiss me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.93,1:02:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, don't you like me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.14,1:03:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bony.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.44,1:03:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bony?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.52,1:03:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever told me that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.11,1:03:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Beef is better than veal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.65,1:03:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ach.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.74,1:03:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a dodo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.32,1:03:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you call this?\NChopped liver?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.57,1:03:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.16,1:03:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.87,1:03:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Master would like more fat.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.20,1:03:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak for yourself, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.96,1:03:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.54,1:03:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"My name is Seymour."
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.46,1:03:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my name, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.71,1:03:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ach. Are you interested are\Nyou just wasting my time?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.38,1:03:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought anybody would volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.68,1:03:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you volunteer?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.93,1:03:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.85,1:03:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, if you're sure\Nyou want to... volunteer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.85,1:03:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. My place or yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.14,1:03:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.52,1:03:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,...\Nflip a coin.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.90,1:03:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have a coin.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.82,1:03:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Flip anything, silly.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.07,1:03:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.28,1:03:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wet or dry?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.70,1:03:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wet.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.68,1:04:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The search was narrowing...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.01,1:04:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and we knew that soon\Nwe would have the killer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.56,1:04:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not that we had any more clues than before.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.68,1:04:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But we had to tell the chief something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.52,1:04:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I had that feeling in my bones that the\Nmystery was frawing to its climax.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.65,1:04:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And I was determined to be on hand.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.52,1:04:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.\NOut, out, out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.86,1:04:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody is in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.86,1:04:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Today we have a special\Noccasion for Seymour Krelborn...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.45,1:04:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,which has invented a big plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.36,1:04:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So I want everybody just please\Nstay out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.83,1:04:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We want Seymour!\NWe want Seymour!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.08,1:04:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We want Seymour!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.59,1:04:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell you, this business is worse than\Nbeing a conductor in a revoluting door.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.92,1:04:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be glad when this day is finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.05,1:04:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But the celebration!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.22,1:04:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They're presenting my son with a trophy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.72,1:04:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? What'd he do -\Nrun away from home?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.68,1:05:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't look at me that way, Audrey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.64,1:05:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.23,1:05:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry Seymour.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.19,1:05:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.90,1:05:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain everything after the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.98,1:05:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo! Police - what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.90,1:05:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Heard there was something\Ngoing on here this evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.61,1:05:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just so, we'd keep come by,\Nkeep an eye on things
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.49,1:05:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Look we don't need no eyes kept on nothing.\NEverything...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.07,1:05:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Society Of Silent Flower\NObservers has arrived...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.95,1:05:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and sunset is almost upon us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.33,1:05:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, lady and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.16,1:05:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We are honoured for to have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.29,1:05:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Still working on those disappearances.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.92,1:05:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We think they were murdered.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.00,1:05:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look here young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.42,1:05:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no way to talk at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.34,1:05:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.13,1:05:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,M-hm.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.22,1:05:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what you got?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.34,1:05:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the facts, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.47,1:05:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Trench mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.39,1:05:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know, I had it back in '09.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.14,1:05:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Better have that looked into, Frank.\N- Whatever you say, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.94,1:05:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krelborn?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.35,1:05:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, the sun is going down now\Nand, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.02,1:05:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,you do think those\Nbuds are going to open?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.82,1:05:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.99,1:05:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if they don't, Mr. Krelborn,...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.74,1:05:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,we shall just have to present\Nthe award at another time.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.62,1:06:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! It's starting to open!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.50,1:06:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Remarkable!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.67,1:06:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Well, the first bud is open.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.72,1:06:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isn't that...\N- The railroad cop.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.55,1:06:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.81,1:06:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaah!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.77,1:06:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think, Frank?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.82,1:06:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all there, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.36,1:06:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.48,1:06:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krelborn,\Nhow do you explain this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.53,1:06:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it.\NI didn't mean it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.07,1:06:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, officer.\NHe didn't mean to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.49,1:06:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.45,1:06:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour, you promised you'd explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.33,1:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting away, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.66,1:06:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.\NLet's catch him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.91,1:06:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.75,1:06:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, now the float will be perfect!\N- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.37,1:10:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't find him\Nhere with the toilets.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.95,1:10:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.81,1:10:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You dirty rat plant.\NYou messed up my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.19,1:10:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed meeeee!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.94,1:10:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll feed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.07,1:10:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll feed you like you've\Nnever been fed before.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.51,1:11:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to give up, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.97,1:11:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't find him tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.73,1:11:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck.\NThe door is open, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.48,1:11:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He was such a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.36,1:11:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Seymour!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.28,1:11:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean it.

